Provenance

The repository began as an import of the Mathlib-only proof of the
Symplectic Stafford formalization (itpplasma/symplectic-stafford-formal,
commit 0e55a8059cc923ef39d6ddb66c5b6f6a2682b46b, Apache-2.0, copyright 2026
ITP Plasma contributors), with generalized filtration hypotheses and a new
namespace. That development and its successors are preserved on branch
archive/pre-palomar-2026-11-02 (commit
7697e11786b4b20e28b6c727650d3cf036232969). The current library replaces it
with a new proof of Theorem A' and Theorem A.

Goldie theory, deviation dimension, the germ calculus, central pencils, Ore
localization of modules and uniform dimension are imported from
AlgebraicAnalysis. Parts of its Goldie theory were first written in this
repository and moved there; AlgebraicAnalysis docs/provenance.yaml records
the move.

scripts/landrun-wrapper.sh is adapted from PalomarRegistry/PalomarTemplate
at commit 128a6c5ce5f48622e69927ccd639cbff401022e8, under Apache-2.0:
https://github.com/PalomarRegistry/PalomarTemplate/blob/128a6c5ce5f48622e69927ccd639cbff401022e8/scripts/landrun-wrapper.sh
The verification scripts follow the layout of itpplasma/stafford38-formal
and itpplasma/global-stafford-formal (Apache-2.0, same author).
